  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fb1e163726c5acd4d8714162c4269516, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialNPC - Z1.1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  npcLines:
  - "Greetings! I know you can\u2019t remember anything right now\u2014you\u2019re not the first to wake up here, but don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll be guiding you."
  - Everyone who appears here is drawn to climb the mountain summit to uncover their past.
  - "I\u2019ll teach you the basics to prepare you for your journey. The higher you climb, the more treacherous it becomes."
  - To move left or right, press A or D.
  - To aim and slingshot launch yourself, hold Spacebar and drag your mouse away from your body.
  signLines:
  - To move left or right, press A or D.
  - To aim and slingshot launch yourself, hold Spacebar and drag your mouse away from your body.
